.SH "نام (NAME)"
easytag \- tag editor for MP3, Ogg Vorbis files and more
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBeasytag\fR\ 'u
\fBeasytag\fR [OPTION]
.HP \w'\fBeasytag\fR\ 'u
\fBeasytag\fR [\fIPATH\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBeasytag\fR
is a utility for viewing and editing tags for MP3, MP2, MP4/AAC, FLAC, Ogg Speex, Ogg Opus, Ogg Vorbis, MusePack, Monkey\*(Aqs Audio and WavPack files\&. Its simple and nice GTK+ interface makes tagging easier under Linux or Windows\&.
.SH "INVOCATION"
.PP
\fBeasytag\fR
can take an
\fIoption\fR
or a
\fIpath\fR
as arguments\&.
.SS "Options"
.PP
\fB\-\-help\fR, \fB\-h\fR
.RS 4
Print brief help and exit\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-\-version\fR, \fB\-v\fR
.RS 4
Print the version and exit\&.
.RE
.SS "Paths"
.PP
Either an absolute or a relative
\fIpath\fR
can be supplied, which will open the path in the browser on startup\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
EasyTAG help manual
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.PP
\fBeasytag\fR
